  "description": "Hyeong-Oh’s disability has always painted a target on his back. It seems like no one at school, from his classmates to his teachers, can stand to treat him like a human being. That is until transfer student Cha Nam-Soo arrives. Quiet and straightforward, he makes no excuses for staying by Hyeong-Oh's side, but can Hyeong-Oh bring himself to trust this new friendship?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
